Description: persistent Codex and GitHub multi-agent orchestrator
 Vibecoder coordinates persistent agents, approved plans, isolated Git
 workspaces and recoverable GitHub workflows. This package installs the local
 runtime and its systemd supervisor. Codex authentication and projects must be
 configured separately before external work is enabled.
